---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Home" 
  description="Benedictine Foundation Pax et Sapientia - ETS. Peace and Wisdom for a sustainable future through the promotion of culture, environment protection, and education."
>
	<section class="relative bg-[#1A2B4C] text-white py-24 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="md:w-2/3">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold mb-6">Peace and Wisdom for a Sustainable Future</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          The Benedictine Foundation Pax et Sapientia - ETS is committed to promoting culture, 
          protecting the environment, and training new generations, inspired by the values of participation and solidarity.
        </p>
        <div class="flex space-x-4 mb-12 lg:mb-0">
          <a href="/en/about" class="bg-[#C5A059] hover:bg-[#b38f4d] text-[#1A2B4C] font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg transition-colors text-center">
            Discover more
          </a>
          <a href="/en/support" class="border-2 border-white hover:bg-white hover:text-[#1A2B4C] text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg transition-colors text-center">
            Support Us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mobile Decorative Logo (Stacked below text) -->
      <div class="lg:hidden flex justify-center mt-12 opacity-20">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/logo.webp" type="image/webp" />
          <img src="/logo.png" alt="" class="w-96 h-96 object-contain" width="384" height="384" loading="lazy" />
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Desktop Decorative Logo (Absolute background) -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 -right-12 w-1/2 h-full -translate-y-1/2 opacity-15 pointer-events-none hidden lg:block">
      <picture>
        <source srcset="/logo.webp" type="image/webp" />
        <img 
          src="/logo.png" 
          alt="" 
          class="w-full h-full object-contain" 
          width="512" 
          height="512" 
          loading="lazy" 
          decoding="async"
        />
      </picture>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C]">Our Fields of Action</h2>
        <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-[#C5A059] mx-auto mt-4"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
        <div class="p-8 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow bg-gray-50">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#1A2B4C] text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-2xl">🎨</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Culture and Art</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Promotion of culture, art, and historical research of particular cultural interest.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow bg-gray-50">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#1A2B4C] text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-2xl">🌿</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Environment</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Protection and enhancement of the environment and cultural and landscape heritage.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow bg-gray-50">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-[#1A2B4C] text-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-2xl">🎓</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Education</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Education, permanent training, and scientific social research.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
